Add CachyOS template variants for other CPU levels to `litterbox define`.

The upstream CachyOS template is fixed to the x86-64-v3 image. This adds two more choices to the
template prompt, identical except for the base image (the Dockerfiles are copies of cachyos.Dockerfile
below its FROM line; tests/pkgbuild.sh fails if they ever drift from upstream's):
  x86-64-v4     docker.io/cachyos/cachyos-v4:latest
  znver4        ghcr.io/bopp-os/cachyos-docker/cachyos-znver4:latest  (built by bopp-os/cachyos-docker)
The existing template is unchanged, only its label now says which CPU level it is.

